---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Corrections and removal" description="How to ask for a correction, an addition or the removal of a tribute on Love You Forever. Family requests are answered first." path="/corrections/">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Corrections, additions and removal</h1>
    <p class="lede">These pages are about real women and their families. If something is wrong, or if you would prefer a page not to exist, we will act quickly.</p>
    <h2>What you can ask</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Correct a name, age, town or other detail.</li>
      <li>Add a memory, a kind word or a fact about her life that her family is happy to share.</li>
      <li>Remove her page completely, with no explanation needed.</li>
      <li>Remove a link or a source.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How</h2>
    <p>Write to <a href="mailto:adeopatapo@gmail.com?subject=Love%20You%20Forever%20request">adeopatapo@gmail.com</a> with the link to the page and what you would like us to do. If you are a relative, please say so.</p>
    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Requests from family members are handled first, and a page is taken offline within 48 hours of a clear request.</li>
      <li>We confirm by email once the change is made.</li>
      <li>We do not ask relatives to prove anything they do not want to share.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Copyright or privacy complaints about any content on this site can use the same address.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
